<title>USA: Esquire Communications names White CFO.</title>
<headline>Esquire Communications names White CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esquire Communications Ltd said Thursday it had named David White as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company also named White and Fir Geenen to its board.</p>
<p>White was most recently president of Laidlaw Inc's MedTrans ambulance and medical transportation company.</p>
